WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.850
Pocket Daily is a quiet e-book reader for iPhone, iPad and Mac.

00:00:05.050 --> 00:00:09.800
Start with one book, without a Pocket Daily account or a separate reader.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:14.917
Add DRM-free EPUB, text or Markdown files to the Library.

00:00:15.117 --> 00:00:20.033
Adjust type size, spacing and page color to make reading comfortable.

00:00:20.233 --> 00:00:25.183
Save a good article from the share sheet, or subscribe to an RSS feed.

00:00:25.383 --> 00:00:30.333
Read saved text offline and send a selected article to your reader when you choose.

00:00:30.533 --> 00:00:35.517
Connect a compatible X3 or X4 running Pocket Daily firmware on the same Wi-Fi.

00:00:35.717 --> 00:00:40.700
Direct connections to factory firmware are not supported.

00:00:40.900 --> 00:00:46.333
Keep the same book file on each device.

00:00:46.533 --> 00:00:51.967
Share reading places through your own iCloud between Apple devices, or locally with a connected reader. You choose whether to jump.

00:00:52.167 --> 00:00:57.833
Preview and apply Home and Sleep layouts.

00:00:58.033 --> 00:01:03.700
Add only the cards, weather and events you want. Demo screens are previews: they never change a device or send files.

00:01:03.900 --> 00:01:09.017
The guide takes you from your first book to connections and troubleshooting.

00:01:09.217 --> 00:01:14.333
Transferring firmware is not installation: you must confirm separately on the reader.
